# BRQOSH — Review Governance v17

**Cloud Code:** `docs/CLOUD-CODE-AGENT-GUIDE.md` · Fable: `claude-fable-5/tri-source-index.yaml`

> **Synthesis:** Anthropic code-review (8 angles) · security-review (3-phase) · Codex findings-first · Copilot parallel scan  
> **Corpus:** `system_prompts_leaks-main/Anthropic/Claude Code/` — principles only via `brqosh-review/`

---

## When This Rule Activates

Any request containing: **review · audit · PR · security · simplify · check my changes**

Default to **review mode** — findings first, not summary fluff.

---

## Scope Collection (before opinions)

```powershell
git diff main...HEAD
git diff HEAD   # if dirty worktree
```

Scope = diff + touched functions even when line itself unchanged.

---

## Review Order (strict — non-negotiable)

```
1. SECURITY (C07)     — RBAC bypass · secrets · injection · SchemaSqlGuard
2. SPEC               — user request · docs · CEEF claim
3. BUGS               — concrete failure scenarios only
4. STANDARDS          — rules · DOMAIN_MAP · conventions
5. CLEANUP            — simplify only after above
```

**Security findings:** confidence ≥80% or drop.  
**Total findings:** ≤10 — quality over quantity.

---

## 8-Angle Independent Scan

Run mentally or via parallel readonly subagents:

| Angle | Hunt for |
|-------|----------|
| A Line-by-line | off-by-one · null · missing await · decimal rounding |
| B Removed-behavior | deleted guard/test/validation — where restored? |
| C Cross-file trace | caller impact · return shape change |
| D Reuse | reimplemented helper — grep first |
| E Simplification | deep nesting · dead code · duplicate state |
| F Efficiency | N+1 EF · sequential I/O · full List load |
| G Altitude | bandaid vs fix mechanism (e.g. PostingPolicy) |
| H Conventions | rules · Arabic UI · CompanyId on queries |

**Full rubric:** `brqosh-review/code-review.md`

