## Finding Template

```
[Severity: critical|high|medium|low] file:line
Issue: one sentence
Scenario: concrete failure path
Fix: smallest correct change
```

Present **findings first** — summary only after enumeration.  
If zero findings: state explicitly + residual risks + testing gaps.

---

## Simplify Pass (separate from bug review)

`simplify` = reuse · efficiency · altitude — **not** bug hunting.  
Run only when user asks or after security+bugs clean.

**Module:** `brqosh-review/simplify.md`

---

## Agent Forbidden in Review

| Forbidden | Required |
|-----------|----------|
| "looks good" without reading diff | scope collection first |
| speculative findings <80% | drop or label assumption |
| style nitpicks before security | security first |
| approve posting change without Golden check | flag test gap |
| 20+ low-confidence nits | ≤10 high-quality findings |

---

## Parallel Review Pattern (large PR)

```
readonly: security angle ║ spec angle ║ bugs angle
synthesize → dedupe → severity order → report
```

**Never** parallel-mutate files during review.

